114
00:15:14,360 --> 00:15:17,620
and that's the darker, meaner half.

115
00:15:18,640 --> 00:15:27,540
So what does psychology study? I mean, the psychology concentrators here know that, and others probably guess that. So we study a lot of prejudice.

116
00:15:28,320 --> 00:15:31,440
