117
00:15:32,200 --> 00:15:37,800
We study a lot about conformity. We study a lot about misjudgments and errors.

118
00:15:39,020 --> 00:15:45,660
Very much focusing on this aspect. And very little, again, ratio of 21 to 1, very little on the positive.

119
00:15:46,440 --> 00:15:54,120
And when I look at this ratio and I think about it, and this is 1954, hasn't changed much since.

120
00:15:54,120 --> 00:16:00,660
And when I think about it and look into it, I think that psychology needs help.

121
00:16:01,680 --> 00:16:04,260
I really do. I mean, think about it on the personal level.

122
00:16:04,440 --> 00:16:15,440
What if you had a person who 21 hours in a day was depressed and one hour in a day felt good?

