00:16:15,440 --> 00:16:24,220
Or one day feeling good and then 21 days feeling anxious and depressed? you would say that this person would need help.

124
00:16:25,640 --> 00:16:32,940
And the field, I think, needs help. But then the question becomes, is it the right analogy? I mean, should we look at it this way?

125
00:16:34,820 --> 00:16:37,480
Because, you know, the 21 ratio is unhealthy,

126
00:16:38,560 --> 00:16:48,600
certainly would be so on an individual level, but it reflects reality in many ways. Because what we're seeing today, and there's more and more research

