00:17:02,220 --> 00:17:08,540
And one could argue, people who argue for continuing to do research in this area and for doing less in positive psychology is,

131
00:17:09,040 --> 00:17:16,040
well, we should be doing even more than the 21 to 1 ratio because we want to alleviate the anxiety and depression that people experience.

