00:17:19,360 --> 00:17:22,880
Today, depression is 10 times higher than it was in 1960.

133
00:17:23,520 --> 00:17:31,960
Now, part of it is because there's more awareness, because we measure better, but that's not all.

134
00:17:32,360 --> 00:17:35,680
It's also simply because objectively there is more depression.

135
00:17:35,940 --> 00:17:46,000
And one way of knowing that is that the most objective, quote-unquote, measure that we have is, unfortunately, suicide.

136
00:17:47,160 --> 00:17:49,700
And numbers have risen significantly.

137
00:17:50,400 --> 00:17:58,500
around the world, not just in the United States, whether it's in China, whether it's in Australia,

