00:18:08,440 --> 00:18:17,160
are introduced to the information highway, and very often they're not prepared, not able to

140
00:18:17,160 --> 00:18:28,780
deal with it in an effective way. So when we look at this data, we say we do need more research to help people overcome depression, to help people overcome anxiety. And I don't want to belittle

141
00:18:28,780 --> 00:18:39,140
that. That is important, extremely important. What I am arguing, what I'm going to argue for is the shift of the pendulum so that it's no longer 21 to one, so that there are

