00:21:14,620 --> 00:21:19,270
In this study, 94% of college students nationwide

167
00:21:22,360 --> 00:21:25,880
feel overwhelmed and stressed by everything that they have to do.

168
00:21:27,360 --> 00:21:30,560
94%. I mean, these are supposed to be the best four years of our lives.

169
00:21:33,520 --> 00:21:39,160
Something's going on here. Now, this is not unique to the United States.

170
00:21:39,980 --> 00:21:51,460
I just recently came back from a tour. I spent time in Europe, in the UK, in France, spent a lot of time in China, and some time in Australia.

171
00:21:52,000 --> 00:21:54,960
In every one of these places, the governments are really concerned.

