00:21:56,200 --> 00:22:02,740
University presidents are really concerned about the growing levels of depression, anxiety, and general mental disorder.

173
00:22:03,360 --> 00:22:07,160
Rise of suicide rates in all of these countries that I mentioned.

174
00:22:08,480 --> 00:22:15,540
So we have a global epidemic here. And once again, going back, so isn't the 21-to-1 ratio good? Isn't it important?

